alphaTheoryCertification -- executes alpha-certification on a given system and list of points
*********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        (D, R, CS, C) = alphaTheoryCertification(PS, L)
  * Inputs:
      * PS, a *note polynomial system: (NAGtypes)PolySystem,, 
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
  * Outputs:
      * D, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of certified distinct
        solutions
      * R, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of certified real
        solutions
      * CS, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of certified solutions
      * C, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of constants for certified
        solutions

Description
===========

This function does all procedures of *note certifyRegularSolution:
certifyRegularSolution,, *note certifyDistinctSolutions:
certifyDistinctSolutions, and *note certifyRealSolution: certifyRealSolution,
at once.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = RR[x1,x2,y1,y2];                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
