certifySolutions -- executes certification on a given system and list of points
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        certifySolutions(PS, P)
  * Inputs:
      * PS, a *note polynomial system: (NAGtypes)PolySystem,, 
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Strategy: CertificationOptions, => ..., default value
        "alphaTheory", options for certification method
  * Outputs:
      * H, a *note mutable hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)MutableHashTable,, a
        MutableHastTable contains data of a list of given solutions

